<section
    class="canva-section chapter"
    data-template-id="music-section"
    id="music"
    style="background:#242631"
>
    <div
        class="chapter-inner grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center"
    >
        <div>
            <p
                class="canva-text eyebrow mb-5"
                data-template-id="music-kicker"
                style="color: rgb(229, 183, 183); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 13px;"
            >
                Chapter three &middot; A song for every feeling
            </p>
            <h2
                class="canva-text chapter-title"
                data-template-id="music-title"
                style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 500; font-style: normal; font-size: 26px;"
            >
                Bengali Music
            </h2>
            <div class="fine-rule my-8"></div>
            <p
                class="canva-text body-copy max-w-lg"
                data-template-id="music-copy"
                style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 18px;"
            >
                There are songs that seem to hold a feeling for us until we are
                ready to hear it again. Here is a little corner for the Bengali
                music you love, and for the memories that live between its
                notes.
            </p>
            <p
                class="canva-text scribble mt-8"
                data-template-id="music-aside"
                style="color: rgb(232, 197, 195); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 22px;"
            >
                For all the melodies that feel like home.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div
            class="canva-card quiet-card relative overflow-hidden p-8 sm:p-12 min-h-[400px] flex flex-col justify-between"
            data-template-id="music-card"
            style="background: rgb(37, 46, 61);"
        >
            <div
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="music-lines absolute top-11 left-0 right-0 opacity-70"
            >
            </div>
            <div
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="relative text-[#d5a9b6] text-5xl tracking-[.6em]"
            >
                &sung; ♫
            </div>
            <div class="relative mt-20">
                <span
                    class="canva-text eyebrow"
                    data-template-id="music-card-kicker"
                    style="color: rgb(229, 183, 183); font-weight: 700; font-style: normal; font-size: 12px;"
                    >Your own little playlist</span
                >
                <h3
                    class="canva-text serif mt-4"
                    data-template-id="music-card-title"
                    style="color: rgb(248, 241, 230); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 29px;"
                >
                    The songs we keep close
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="canva-text body-copy mt-4"
                    data-template-id="music-card-copy"
                    style="color: rgb(223, 214, 204); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-size: 16px;"
                >
                    Add a favorite song, a lyric, or the memory a melody brings
                    back.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center mt-12">
            <a
                aria-label="Continue to football"
                class="canva-link section-next"
                data-template-id="music-next"
                href="#football"
                style="color: rgb(255, 244, 223); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; font-size: 15px;"
                >Next chapter &darr;</a
            >
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
